# Development: empty VITE_API_URL → Vite proxy forwards:
#   /api/*        → https://api-mashena.wasta-jobs.com  (HTTP)
#   /socket.io/*  → https://api-mashena.wasta-jobs.com  (HTTP + WebSocket)
#
# The browser stores cookies for localhost.
# The proxy forwards them to the backend on every request/socket handshake.
# No VITE_API_URL or VITE_SOCKET_URL needed here — window.location.origin is used.
